        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "1 General",
            "block_bbox": [
                351,
                179,
                437,
                199
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    351.0,
                    179.0
                ],
                [
                    436.0,
                    179.0
                ],
                [
                    436.0,
                    198.0
                ],
                [
                    351.0,
                    198.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) It is recognized by both parties that the needs of the business may require work in excess of Scheduled Tours and that the jobs involved must be adequately manned by qualified Employees working on an overtime basis.",
            "block_bbox": [
                374,
                203,
                908,
                275
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    374.0,
                    203.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    203.0
                ],
                [
                    908.0,
                    275.0
                ],
                [
                    374.0,
                    275.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) When, in the judgment of the Company, work in excess of Scheduled Tours is necessary, the Employees involved shall be given at least twenty-four (24) hours' notice unless unknown or unforeseen conditions prevent the Company from giving such notice, and the Union shall be notified in advance as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                374,
                280,
                909,
                370
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    374.0,
                    280.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    280.0
                ],
                [
                    909.0,
                    370.0
                ],
                [
                    374.0,
                    370.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) When overtime work involves a Job Location, the Job Steward involved shall be notified.",
            "block_bbox": [
                404,
                374,
                907,
                412
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    404.0,
                    374.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    374.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    412.0
                ],
                [
                    404.0,
                    412.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) When overtime involves several Job Locations which are under the jurisdiction of a Representative, the Representative shall be notified instead of the Job Steward. If the Union organization does not provide such contacts, the individual Job Stewards or Local President shall be notified.",
            "block_bbox": [
                404,
                417,
                907,
                505
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    404.0,
                    417.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    417.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    505.0
                ],
                [
                    404.0,
                    505.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) When overtime is expected to be general throughout the Area, the Local President shall be notified.",
            "block_bbox": [
                404,
                511,
                906,
                548
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    404.0,
                    511.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    511.0
                ],
                [
                    906.0,
                    548.0
                ],
                [
                    404.0,
                    548.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c) The amount of overtime and the schedule for working such overtime will be established by the Company. However, the schedule or general pattern for the working of overtime, except in the case of non-recurring overtime in effect for one (1) week or less, shall, upon request of the Union, become a matter for negotiations as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                372,
                553,
                907,
                643
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    372.0,
                    553.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    553.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    643.0
                ],
                [
                    372.0,
                    643.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) The matter shall first be discussed by the Job Steward and the Supervisor or the Representative and the Operations Area Manager. Where a mutually satisfactory schedule is not readily established by such discussion, the matter shall be referred to the Local President and the Operations Director for negotiation.",
            "block_bbox": [
                404,
                647,
                907,
                737
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    404.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    647.0
                ],
                [
                    907.0,
                    737.0
                ],
                [
                    404.0,
                    737.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The schedule established by the Company shall remain in effect during such negotiations.",
            "block_bbox": [
                404,
                741,
                906,
                779
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
