                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(d) For 7-Day Coverage Employees, Saturday and Sunday as used in this Article shall mean the Employees' Days in Lieu of Saturday and Sunday, respectively, defined as follows:",
